     safe circle. Handle, blade and corkscrew are Lucide's pocket-knife paths (ISC; the notice is
     in THIRD-PARTY.md at the repo root) on Lucide's 24-unit grid, inside a group that maps the
     knife's bounding circle onto the safe circle, so strokeWidth 2 is about 4.55 dp. Tools first,
     handle on top, so their end caps hide under it. Source: app/icons/thorcuts-launcher.svg. -->
